poptosis resistance and proinvasive phenotype of Kaposi's sarcoma cells</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2004b</year><volume>279</volume><fpage>4136</fpage><lpage>4143</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Biol Chem||279|4136||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14627715</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Catrina</surname><given-names>AI</given-names></name><name><surname>Ulfgren</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Lindblad</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Grondal</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Klareskog</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Low levels of apoptosis and high FLIP expression in early rheumatoid arthritis synovium</article-title><source>Ann Rheum Dis</source><year>2002</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>934</fpage><lpage>936</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Ann Rheum Dis||61|934||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12228167</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Catrina</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Catrina</surname><given-names>AI</given-names></name><name><surname>Sirzen</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Griffiths</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergman</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Biberfeld</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Coculescu</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mutt</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A cytotoxic, apoptotic, low-molecular weight factor from pineal gland</article-title><source>Life Sci</source><year>1999</year><volume>65</volume><fpage>1047</fpage><lpage>1057</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Life Sci||65|1047||bib10|'-->